('wikiloc', '215126719', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/iii-trail-solidaria-guardia-civil-062-215126719', 'III GUARDIA CIVIL 062 CHARITY TRAIL', '{"en":"Cabrerizas loop via Quemadero viewpoint","ca":"Circular Cabrerizas pel Mirador del Quemadero","es":"Circular Cabrerizas por Mirador del Quemadero"}'::jsonb, 'III TRAIL SOLIDARIA GUARDIA CIVIL 062 Hiking trail in Cabrerizas, Melilla (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Ruta de Cabrerizas a Fuerte de Rostrogordo pasando por: 
