('wikiloc', '217408013', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/cami-del-ruda-saboredo-refuge-port-de-ratera-2-583-m-tuc-de-ratera-2-853-m-lac-major-de-saboredo-an-217408013', 'Cami del Ruda - Saboredo Refuge - Port de Ratera (2,583 m)- Tuc de Ratera (2,853 m) - Lac Major de Saboredo and return', '{"en":"Saboredo refuge loop via Ruda valley","ca":"Circular refugi de Saboredo per la vall de Ruda","es":"Circular refugio de Saboredo por el valle de Ruda"}'::jsonb, 'Cami del Ruda - Saboredo Refuge - Port de Ratera (2,583 m)- Tuc de Ratera (2,853 m) - Lac Major de Saboredo and return Hiking trail in Baqueira-Beret, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. This route starts at the parking area for the Saboredo Refuge in the Vall de Ruda area. The road access here is open to drive in the summer but is very rough and good car clearance is recommended. The hike starts on a well-established trail with relatively gradual ascent up to the refuge in just under 4.5 km. From the Refuge it continues along the well-marked trail past Lac deth Miei and Lac de Naut. From here, the trail ascended more quickly towards Port de Ratera and required straight forward snow crossings at this time of year. 

At the pass (already with lovely views here), the route up to the summit of Ratera is on a clear trail with rock cairn milestones. The climb is steep but not technical, and the summit rewards with stunning panoramic views. The return retraces the route back to Lac de Naut, with a side trip for an ice lake dip. At the end of Lac de Naut I left the main trail to hike over the small rise separating Lac de Naut and Llacs de Saboredo. There was a faint trail with milestones I soon connected with and quickly arrived at the shores of Lac Major de Saboredo - a gorgeous lake well worth the detour! 

 I followed a single track path along the lakeshore to the large dam at the end which I crossed over to the other side. The trail follows to the right of the stream/waterfall coming down from the lake, until crossing a wooden bridge about 0.4km down from the dam. Immediately after the bridge I turned right off the trail to do a direct, straightforward connection to the route down. If you continue straight you will reach the refuge again and can descend from there as well. Overall a great day, this is a beautiful, rewarding hike that is well worth the effort!

NOTE: my garmin watch recorded the distance as 17.03 km and 1,120 meters elevation gain - just as reference for planning as the wikiloc recording is not as accurate.', '{"en":"This moderate loop begins at the Saboredo Refuge parking in Vall de Ruda. The access road is rough but open in summer, requiring a vehicle with good clearance. The trail to the refuge is well-established and gradually ascends for 4.5 km.\n\nBeyond the refuge, the path continues past Lac deth Miei and Lac de Naut, with a steeper ascent towards Port de Ratera, potentially involving straightforward snow crossings. From the pass, a clear, cairn-marked trail leads steeply but non-technically to the summit of Tuc de Ratera, offering panoramic views. The return includes a detour to Lac Major de Saboredo, a beautiful lake worth exploring.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada comença a l''aparcament del Refugi de Saboredo a la Vall de Ruda. La carretera d''accés és irregular però oberta a l''estiu, requerint un vehicle amb bona alçada lliure. El camí fins al refugi està ben marcat i ascendeix gradualment durant 4,5 km.\n\nMés enllà del refugi, el sender continua passant pel Lac deth Miei i el Lac de Naut, amb una pujada més pronunciada cap al Port de Ratera, que pot implicar creuar neu fàcilment. Des del coll, un camí clar marcat amb fites porta de manera pronunciada però no tècnica al cim del Tuc de Ratera, oferint vistes panoràmiques. El retorn inclou un desviament cap al Lac Major de Saboredo, un llac preciós que val la pena explorar.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada comienza en el aparcamiento del Refugio de Saboredo en la Vall de Ruda. La carretera de acceso es irregular pero abierta en verano, requiriendo un vehículo con buena altura libre. El sendero hasta el refugio está bien establecido y asciende gradualmente durante 4,5 km.\n\nMás allá del refugio, el camino continúa pasando por el Lac deth Miei y el Lac de Naut, con un ascenso más pronunciado hacia el Port de Ratera, que puede implicar cruces de nieve sencillos. Desde el collado, un sendero claro marcado con hitos lleva de forma pronunciada pero no técnica a la cumbre del Tuc de Ratera, ofreciendo vistas panorámicas. El regreso incluye un desvío hacia el Lac Major de Saboredo, un lago hermoso que vale la pena explorar."}'::jsonb, 'Aviva.laub', 15450, 1033, 1033, 2851, 1855, 'moderate', 'loop', 16800, 27360, 2790, '2025-06-08', '2025-05', '[{"lat":42.641788,"lng":0.971896,"ele":1858.9},{"lat":42.641733,"lng":0.971879,"ele":1859.4},{"lat":42.641682,"lng":0.971862,"ele":1859.6},{"lat":42.641644,"lng":0.971823,"ele":1859.8},{"lat":42.641602,"lng":0.971784,"ele":1860},{"lat":42.641569,"lng":0.97174,"ele":1860},{"lat":42.641549,"lng":0.971679,"ele":1860.2},{"lat":42.641546,"lng":0.971617,"ele":1860.5},{"lat":42.641539,"lng":0.971549,"ele":1860.8},{"lat":42.641529,"lng":0.971482,"ele":1861.1},{"lat":42.641532,"lng":0.97142,"ele":1861.7},{"lat":42.641524,"lng":0.971348,"ele":1862.4},{"lat":42.641498,"lng":0.971289,"ele":1862.7},{"lat":42.641473,"lng":0.971227,"ele":1863},{"lat":42.641443,"lng":0.971177,"ele":1863.5},{"lat":42.6414,"lng":0.971154,"ele":1863.9},{"lat":42.641352,"lng":0.971133,"ele":1864.5},{"lat":42.641304,"lng":0.971143,"ele":1865.3},{"lat":42.641257,"lng":0.971124,"ele":1865.8},{"lat":42.641213,"lng":0.971105,"ele":1866.3},{"lat":42.641161,"lng":0.971087,"ele":1867},{"lat":42.641117,"lng":0.971059,"ele":1867.5},{"lat":42.641079,"lng":0.971019,"ele":1867.8},{"lat":42.641039,"lng":0.970977,"ele":1868.3},{"lat":42.641004,"lng":0.970926,"ele":1868.7},{"lat":42.640954,"lng":0.97092,"ele":1869},{"lat":42.640902,"lng":0.970929,"ele":1869.6},{"lat":42.640857,"lng":0.970896,"ele":1870},{"lat":42.640807,"lng":0.970876,"ele":1870.2},{"lat":42.640776,"lng":0.970826,"ele":1870.7},{"lat":42.640743,"lng":0.97078,"ele":1871.9},{"lat":42.640703,"lng":0.970733,"ele":1873.3},{"lat":42.640674,"lng":0.970681,"ele":1874.3},{"lat":42.640656,"lng":0.970619,"ele":1874.5},{"lat":42.640643,"lng":0.970557,"ele":1874.